    {
      "id": "p0039-b002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "When you think about it, many video games basically boil down to \"you beat up and/or kill the bad guys\". It's almost the expected \"default\" of any game. This was true for beloved classics like Pac-Man, Space Invaders, and Super Mario Bros., and it's just as true for games released today.",
        "raw": "When you think about it, many video games basically boil down to \"you beat up\nand/or kill the bad guys\". It's almost the expected \"default\" of any game. This\nwas true for beloved classics like Pac-Man, Space Invaders, and Super Mario\nBros., and it's just as true for games released today.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.10426342,
          0.09272143,
          0.70656239,
          0.15860714
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.10224944,
          0.09200714,
          0.7114362,
          0.15967857
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          2,
          3,
          4,
          7
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "仔细想想，很多游戏归根到底都是“打倒或杀死坏人”。这几乎成了玩家默认的游戏规则。备受喜爱的《Pac-Man》《Space Invaders》和《Super Mario Bros.》等经典如此，今天的新游戏也一样。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
          {
            "start": 46,
            "end": 53,
            "italic": true,
            "lang": "en"
          },
          {
            "start": 55,
