    {
      "id": "p0039-b008",
      "kind": "caption",
      "source": {
        "text": "Enemies in Undertale are actual characters in the game with feelings and motivations of their own. You can treat them like standard video game battle fodder, or you can let them live and befriend them. The choice you make each time will change the game in big and small ways!",
        "raw": "Enemies in Underta/e are actual characters in the game with feelings and motivations of their\nown. You can treat them like standard video game battle fodder, or you can let them live and\nbefriend them. The choice you make each time will change the game in big and small ways!",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.10814032,
          0.74340714,
          0.68144813,
          0.78511429
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.10683123,
          0.74269286,
          0.68275722,
          0.78618571
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          56,
          57,
          58
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "Undertale 的敌人是有感情、有动机的角色。你可以把他们当成普通游戏里的战斗炮灰，也可以放他们活着，与他们交朋友。每一次选择都会或大或小地改变游戏！",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
