    {
      "id": "p0039-b009",
      "kind": "aside",
      "source": {
        "text": "Who you are really does seem to impact your Undertale experience. Impatient players tend to rush through, kill everything, and skip all the text. Cautious players stop to analyze every choice. Judgmental players begin with an already unswayable opinion. Timid players constantly worry about upsetting enemies in battle. It's an interesting phenomenon to see!",
        "raw": "Who you are really does seem to impact your Undertale experience.\nImpatient players tend to rush through, kill everything, and skip all the\ntext. Cautious players stop to analyze every choice. Judgmental players\nbegin with an already unswayable opinion. Timid players constantly worry\nabout upsetting enemies in battle. It's an interesting phenomenon to see!",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.12614524,
          0.81685,
          0.68476112,
          0.88952143
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.12483616,
          0.81613571,
          0.6860702,
          0.89059286
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          59,
          60,
          61,
          62,
          63
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "你是怎样的人，似乎真会影响 Undertale 的体验。急性子往往一路冲，见谁杀谁，跳过所有文字；谨慎的人停下来分析每个选择；爱下判断的人还没开始，就已有不可动摇的看法；胆小的人则总担心在战斗中惹敌人生气。这个现象很有意思！",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
          {
            "start": 14,
            "end": 23,
            "italic": true,
            "lang": "en"
          }
        ]
